<title>YEMEN: Yemen to restore Aden airport for $20mln.</title>
<headline>Yemen to restore Aden airport for $20mln.</headline>
<dateline>ADEN 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yemen plans to use $20 million in aid to repair its airport in the southern city of Aden damaged by the 1994 civil war, a government official said on Monday.</p>
<p>The World Bank has offered a $14 million loan while France would provide technical equipment worth six million dollars, he said. Actual construction would start early next year.</p>
</text>
